---
layout: null
permalink: /publications.bib
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
Machine-readable citations generated from _data/publications.yml, so this file
can never drift from the research page.

Entry type is inferred from the venue, which is right for every current record.
To override one, add `entry_type: article` (or inproceedings) to its entry in
the data file rather than editing the rule below.

DOIs are taken from `doi:` when present, otherwise extracted from a doi.org
paper URL. Records whose paper link points elsewhere (IEEE Xplore, ACL
Anthology, arXiv, OpenReview) simply carry `url` and no `doi`.

Titles are wrapped in double braces so BibTeX styles cannot lowercase the
acronyms that fill these titles (LLM, AI, Wi-Fi, RF-VNIR).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ob = '{' -%}
{%- assign cb = '}' -%}
% BibTeX citations for {{ site.author.name }}
% {{ '/research/' | absolute_url }}
% Generated automatically from the site's publication data. Last built {{ site.time | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}.
{% for publication in site.data.publications %}
{%- assign venue = publication.venue -%}
{%- assign entry_type = 'inproceedings' -%}
{%- if venue contains 'Journal' or venue contains 'Transactions' or venue contains 'IMWUT' or venue contains 'Letters' or venue contains 'Magazine' -%}
  {%- assign entry_type = 'article' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if publication.entry_type.size > 0 -%}{%- assign entry_type = publication.entry_type -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
Test with `size > 0`, never `size == 0`: a missing key is nil, and nil.size is
nil, so `== 0` is false and the fallback below would never run.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign doi = publication.doi -%}
{%- unless doi.size > 0 -%}
  {%- if publication.paper contains 'doi.org/' -%}
    {%- assign doi = publication.paper | split: 'doi.org/' | last -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endunless -%}
@{{ entry_type }}{{ ob }}{{ publication.id }},
  title     = {{ ob }}{{ ob }}{{ publication.title }}{{ cb }}{{ cb }},
  author    = {{ ob }}{{ publication.authors | split: ', ' | join: ' and ' }}{{ cb }},
  {% if entry_type == 'article' %}journal  {% else %}booktitle{% endif %} = {{ ob }}{{ venue }}{{ cb }},
  year      = {{ ob }}{{ publication.year }}{{ cb }},
{%- if doi.size > 0 %}
  doi       = {{ ob }}{{ doi }}{{ cb }},
{%- endif %}
  url       = {{ ob }}{{ publication.paper | absolute_url }}{{ cb }}
{{ cb }}
{% endfor %}
